{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010910/extras/9a1b1119b561a6c2c11791d2e73e631a.poster.avif?t=1774692929\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010910/extras/9a1b1119b561a6c2c11791d2e73e631a.webm?t=1774692929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010910/extras/9a1b1119b561a6c2c11791d2e73e631a.mp4?t=1774692929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u227d^\u2022\u2a4a\u2022^\u227c\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You, the Cat, are the son of a cat named Meow. Nothing else is known to you. You have 9 lives. The castle has thousands of ways to take them. Can you recover your memory and escape?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you in the castle's labyrinths:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> You awaken in a cold and gloomy castle, not even knowing your name. How did you get here? What do these walls hide? The answers lie at the heart of this dangerous labyrinth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic and Speed:</strong> Use your feline reflexes and magical abilities to maneuver between deadly traps and cunning enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles at Every Turn:</strong> Collect keys, jump through ancient portals, and find hidden levers. Each level is a logical challenge requiring precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasures and Secrets:</strong> The ancient castle is full of gold and magical crystals. Can you collect them all without falling into the clutches of fast and cunning enemies?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fairy Tale Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in a stylish world where deep shadows contrast with the bright glow of magic and gold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to embark on this dangerous journey to save a cute furball?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2571|\u3001 <br>(\u02da\u02ce \u30027  <br>|\u3001\u02dc\u3035  <br>\u3058\u3057\u02cd,)\u30ce</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The game supports various control scenarios.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard</strong>:<br>Pause - ESC, Tab, I<br>Movement - WASD or arrows<br>Action - F, Space, Enter<br>Shield - Shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse:</strong><br>Scroll through levels in the main menu - use the mouse wheel.<br>Movement - Hold the left mouse button and drag to jump in the desired direction.<br>Action - Right mouse button.<br>Shield - Middle mouse button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad on Xbox example</strong>:<br>Scroll levels in the main menu - use the right stick.<br>Pause - Left center button.<br>Movement - Use the left stick or arrows.<br>Action - A, X.<br>Shield - Y, B.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First jumps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010910/021ec895c2b299cbd8b0e13cb3a1591408a975a4.jpg"},{"name":"Elusive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010910/6a0722bb56262b19e0efafba292676f00652e43c.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010910/acea36a727dea17355383b5826954d0db61da8ce.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010910/d68750c66c3f09b704f927cd79f3c72c46251b8a.jpg"},{"name":"An easy walk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010910/f9a0366248c45a8f9a91effa38fc0d51e3543dc2.jpg"},{"name":"Indomitable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/401